<title>FRANCE: French June official reserves rose to 331.46 bln F.</title>
<headline>French June official reserves rose to 331.46 bln F.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  Jun    May</p>
<p> Total reserves		   331.463  318.910</p>
<p> Gold				 162.460  159.521</p>
<p> Ecu				   55.296   54.628</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  93.612   86.049</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  20.095   18.712</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
